Curatorial Notes:
Description derived from the research of Kamer Aga-Oglu ('The Williams Collection of Far Eastern Ceramics', Ann Arbor, 1972}. Uthara. 03/24/05.
The lid, although it fits well, does not seem to belong to it.
A similar ewer is in the Seligman Collection {J. Ayers, 'The Seligman Collection of Oriental Art, Vol. II, Chinese and Korean Pottery and Porcelain', Pl. LIII, D162, London, 1964}
